  "dct_description_sm": [
    "A global terrain model for ocean and land, providing elevation data, in meters, on a 15 arc-second interval grid. It is accompanied by a Type Identifier (TID) Grid that gives information on the types of source data that the GEBCO 2023 Grid is based on. This release includes a version of the grid with under-ice topography/bathymetry information for Greenland and Antarctica.",
    "Dataset includes data files (24 GeoTIFFs).",
